1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660
Normally it's the front row, but

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:03,760
today, specially, it's

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,810
not the front row.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,490
You're spared!

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,380
It's the second, third row.

6
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,040
Plot twist,

7
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:18,110
wrong way! No, no, no, I got some

8
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,150
information just before!

9
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,310
The girl who works here told me…

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:23,340
"There are people from the SNCF…"

11
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,620
She told me what?

12
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:27,660
She said: "There are sons of b…"

13
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,880
I went: "What?"

14
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,580
"Ticket inspectors! Sorry, that was a

15
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,190
slip of the tongue!"

16
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,880
I have a message for you! Really,

17
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,130
it's great that you're here,

18
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,050
but screw you!

19
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:51,930
No, no,

20
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,920
we want to go on holiday, and you,

21
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,300
you go on strike? What's the deal?

22
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:06,800
This is gonna turn into a fight, it's

23
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:07,230
gonna kick off!

24
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,660
Ticket inspectors… I can't, I

25
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,980
can't. Why do you wait until we

26
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:11,160
fall asleep to show up?

27
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:13,920
"Tickets please"? Why?

28
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,800
Check us at the start, right at the start!

29
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,300
One guy takes your health

30
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:19,360
pass, scans your code, and then

31
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,320
checks you a second time!

32
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,390
You people are dangerous!

33
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,070
Which line do you work?

34
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,720
Audience: Saint-Lazare! — Saint-Lazare?

35
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,420
What's that? That's all…

36
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:28,230
Audience: Versailles, Nanterre,

37
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,190
RER A! — Wow, that's rough.

38
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:30,900
What are you?

39
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,060
You're the new inspectors,

40
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:32,960
the ones who go…

41
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,550
"Bam!" when they walk in?

42
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:41,470
Did you think you were the Avengers or

43
00:01:41,470 --> 00:01:41,800
what?

44
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:46,630
They failed the police exam!

45
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,510
"RATP Security!"

46
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,580
"SNCF Police!"

47
00:01:55,580 --> 00:01:57,030
They've got a plastic gun!

48
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:03,300
They only ever arrest illegal immigrants!

49
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,690
Okay, okay…

50
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:11,020
Me, I'm loving this, loving it.

51
00:02:11,330 --> 00:02:13,500
Audience: That's the squad!

52
00:02:13,550 --> 00:02:15,340
I swear, I saw the ad on TV.

53
00:02:15,410 --> 00:02:16,440
Look at this ad!

54
00:02:16,690 --> 00:02:17,580
The guys walk in.

55
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:19,310
That's you, the famous…

56
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,880
They show up, they walk in.

57
00:02:21,110 --> 00:02:23,300
Like, they're plain-clothes inspectors.

58
00:02:23,410 --> 00:02:24,320
They walk in like this.

59
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:31,270
Best laugh I've had all of 2021!

60
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:33,840
Go home

61
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,970
and watch that ad!

62
00:02:35,660 --> 00:02:36,420
So you do all this.

63
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:38,700
Who brought you here?

64
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:41,240
Was it you, madam?

65
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,680
What do you do?

66
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:44,800
You check people's tickets too?

67
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,570
And how's it going? All good?

68
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,740
Do you get bonuses the more people

69
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:51,840
you catch, or not?

70
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,890
Audience: No! Well, that's why we're here!
